  "notes": "12-step blue scale with a matching dark-mode scale. Steps 1-2: app and subtle backgrounds. 3-5: component backgrounds (normal, hover, pressed). 6-8: borders and focus rings. 9-10: solid backgrounds (e.g. buttons). 11-12: low and high contrast text.\n\nAlso available: blueA (alpha) and P3 wide-gamut versions.\n\nUse: npm i @radix-ui/colors, then import \"@radix-ui/colors/blue.css\" and \"@radix-ui/colors/blue-dark.css\".\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/radix-ui/colors/blob/main/src/light.ts",
  "code": "<style>\n:root {\n  --blue-1: #fbfdff;\n  --blue-2: #f4faff;\n  --blue-3: #e6f4fe;\n  --blue-4: #d5efff;\n  --blue-5: #c2e5ff;\n  --blue-6: #acd8fc;\n  --blue-7: #8ec8f6;\n  --blue-8: #5eb1ef;\n  --blue-9: #0090ff;\n  --blue-10: #0588f0;\n  --blue-11: #0d74ce;\n  --blue-12: #113264;\n}\n.dark {\n  --blue-1: #0d1520;\n  --blue-2: #111927;\n  --blue-3: #0d2847;\n  --blue-4: #003362;\n  --blue-5: #004074;\n  --blue-6: #104d87;\n  --blue-7: #205d9e;\n  --blue-8: #2870bd;\n  --blue-9: #0090ff;\n  --blue-10: #3b9eff;\n  --blue-11: #70b8ff;\n  --blue-12: #c2e6ff;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Radix blue</strong>\n<p>light</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#fbfdff\" title=\"--blue-1: #fbfdff\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#f4faff\" title=\"--blue-2: #f4faff\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#e6f4fe\" title=\"--blue-3: #e6f4fe\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#d5efff\" title=\"--blue-4: #d5efff\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#c2e5ff\" title=\"--blue-5: #c2e5ff\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#acd8fc\" title=\"--blue-6: #acd8fc\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#8ec8f6\" title=\"--blue-7: #8ec8f6\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#5eb1ef\" title=\"--blue-8: #5eb1ef\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#0090ff\" title=\"--blue-9: #0090ff\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#0588f0\" title=\"--blue-10: #0588f0\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#0d74ce\" title=\"--blue-11: #0d74ce\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#113264\" title=\"--blue-12: #113264\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n<p>dark</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#0d1520\" title=\"--blue-1: #0d1520\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#111927\" title=\"--blue-2: #111927\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#0d2847\" title=\"--blue-3: #0d2847\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#003362\" title=\"--blue-4: #003362\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#004074\" title=\"--blue-5: #004074\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#104d87\" title=\"--blue-6: #104d87\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#205d9e\" title=\"--blue-7: #205d9e\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#2870bd\" title=\"--blue-8: #2870bd\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#0090ff\" title=\"--blue-9: #0090ff\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#3b9eff\" title=\"--blue-10: #3b9eff\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#70b8ff\" title=\"--blue-11: #70b8ff\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#c2e6ff\" title=\"--blue-12: #c2e6ff\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
